sequenceDiagram
  actor Student as 学生
  participant View as HomeworkSubmissionView
  participant Attachment as AttachmentController/Service
  participant Submission as SubmissionController/Service
  participant Permission as CoursePermissionClient
  participant Storage as FileStorageService
  participant AttachmentRepo as AttachmentRepository
  participant SubmissionRepo as SubmissionRepository
  participant EvaluationRepo as JdbcHomeworkEvaluationRepository
  participant Worker as HomeworkEvaluationWorker
  participant Recovery as HomeworkEvaluationRecovery
  participant Evaluator as 共享 Evaluator
  opt FILE 作业上传
    Student->>View: 选择一个文件并上传
    View->>Attachment: POST API-HWK-23
    Attachment->>Permission: 校验成员、课程与作业
    Permission-->>Attachment: 返回允许
    Attachment->>Storage: 保存物理对象
    Storage-->>Attachment: 返回存储结果
    Attachment->>AttachmentRepo: 保存 UPLOADED/24h 元数据
    AttachmentRepo-->>Attachment: 返回 fileId
    Attachment-->>View: 返回 fileId 与安全元数据
  end
  Student->>View: 提交答案、代码或 fileId
  View->>Submission: POST API-HWK-07
  Submission->>Permission: 校验成员和作业访问
  Permission-->>Submission: 返回允许
  Submission->>SubmissionRepo: 校验截止/次数并保存新版本
  Submission->>AttachmentRepo: UPLOADED 原子绑定为 BOUND
  alt OBJECTIVE
    Submission->>EvaluationRepo: 保存 OBJECTIVE_AUTO 终态与得分
    Submission->>SubmissionRepo: 回写评测终态与分数
  else CODE
    Submission->>EvaluationRepo: 保存 CODE_JUDGE/PENDING 评测记录
  else TEXT/FILE
    Submission->>SubmissionRepo: 标记待人工批阅
    SubmissionRepo-->>Submission: 返回待批阅状态
  end
  Submission-->>View: 返回提交回执与可见状态
  Submission-->>Worker: AFTER_COMMIT 投递 HomeworkEvaluationTaskCreated
  opt 首次派发遗漏、线程池拒绝或进程重启
    Recovery->>EvaluationRepo: 定时读取 PENDING；启动重置遗留 RUNNING
    EvaluationRepo-->>Recovery: 返回可恢复 CODE_JUDGE 任务
    Recovery-->>Worker: 重新投递 HomeworkEvaluationTaskCreated
  end
  Worker->>EvaluationRepo: 条件更新 PENDING 为 RUNNING
  EvaluationRepo-->>Worker: 返回认领结果
  Worker->>Evaluator: 使用共享 EvaluationTask 执行 IO 评测
  Evaluator-->>Worker: 返回 EvaluationResult
  alt 评测正常完成
    Worker->>EvaluationRepo: 回写评测终态与日志
    Worker->>SubmissionRepo: 回写评测终态与分数
  else Worker 或评测器异常
    Worker->>EvaluationRepo: 回写 SYSTEM_ERROR
    Worker->>SubmissionRepo: 保留提交并标记 SYSTEM_ERROR
  end
  View->>Submission: GET API-HWK-10/11 查询结果
  Submission->>EvaluationRepo: 只读最新评测记录
  EvaluationRepo-->>Submission: 返回 PENDING/RUNNING/终态
  Submission-->>View: 返回可见结果
  View-->>Student: 展示安全反馈与历史入口
